    <div style="background-color: #f0f4f8; padding: 16px; text-align: center;">
        <p style="color: #aaa; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;">This is an automated message from the Learning Management System.</p>
    </div>
</div>
        ]]></field>
    </record>

